### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------
### DEMO PAIR — deliberately left as ONE SIDE ONLY. Post the NEED now (run this
### request as part of your seed run), then during your actual live demo,
### run the SURPLUS request below in front of the audience to trigger a real,
### fresh, on-camera match — this is your "wow" moment, don't run both now.
### ----------------------------------------------------------------------------

### NEED: Canned Food, 200 units, eastside_foodbank — run this now
POST {{baseUrl}}/listings
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": {{foodbankId}},
  "categoryId": 2,
  "type": "NEED",
  "quantity": 200,
  "quantityRemaining": 200,
  "urgency": "MEDIUM",
  "neededBy": "2026-11-05",
  "status": "OPEN",
  "anonymous": false
}

